>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Label-Checked"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Paleo Protein Powder</Fragment>
      Paleo rules out whey, pea and soy, which leaves four animal proteins: beef isolate, egg white, bone broth and collagen. They are not equal. We compared them on leucine, completeness and what 25 g of protein actually costs.
    </ArticleHeader>

